{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1715.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"6efdf5082b13067e7653cad9bfc7f1cafd224f6ee4e57c7c4fe1189768b8548f","ja":"スクープを目指して！","zh":"以独家新闻为目标！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1715.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"dbfdc383d5d1ba54c5cd889391b24516cd7aed5012fc5e5a2b4a1e9c8b5aa1b4","ja":"（次こそ大スクープを掴んでみせます！\nチヅルは今、この近くにいるはず……）","zh":"（下次一定要抓到特大独家新闻！\n千鹤现在应该就在这附近……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1715.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5ec0cde617292ac1e1314b4b6bb70e7c6938b26cccae3406c8317050775d0c38","ja":"こちら右から左まですべて、\n購入させていただきますわ！　おーほっほっほ！","zh":"这里从右到左所有的东西，\n我全都要买下来！　哦～呵呵呵！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1715.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"0f8c9e02c84cd3446856aab0c0b6c4985709d8603bae035ceeb93efabe1a150a","ja":"（さすがチズルです～！\nセレブのショッピングはいい記事に……）","zh":"（真不愧是千鹤小姐～！\n名流的购物一定能写成好报道……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1715.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"65a8de69d69f5ba638feed994f62494874586010dfec872f6e23414089dd9e1b","ja":"「はい、オッケーです！\n千鶴さんなら本当に買えるんでしょうね。あはは」","zh":"「好，没问题！\n千鹤的话，肯定真能买得起吧。啊哈哈」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1715.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"0ea910c19aae80bf4f2661f7e5b2817cd22114bbec4938a06dc09cdc3f48e638","ja":"えっ？　ええ、まあ……おほほほ……。","zh":"哎？嗯，算是吧……呵呵呵呵……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1715.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"84724efdb67424647437d5b17368adde1ceb2f0998a422a1ff63c82908368cd9","ja":"（えっ！　演技だったんですか！？）","zh":"（诶！那是演技吗！？）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1715.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"9372a04a145f5d7e9797939c06f8a04f0e1cbd26f5667ea41846177d9f31bbd7","ja":"（こ、今度こそ、ビッグニュースをゲットします！\nチハヤとシズカがレッスンルームにいるはず……）","zh":"（这、这次一定要挖到大新闻！\n千早和静香应该在练习室……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1715.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"3d76b04410c90dc36a60c688860f688e82a9dcd36f725a466cf9b193bf917629","ja":"千早さんの歌、大好きです。でも私だって\n負けられません。本気で歌わせていただきます！","zh":"我很喜欢千早前辈的歌声。但我\n也是不会认输的。我会全力以赴放声歌唱！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1715.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"464fe684e3c24a7f94d3ea2263b48174313279efb202765e637f498f800eb047","ja":"わかったわ、ぜひ聞かせて。\n私も全身全霊で歌うから。","zh":"我知道了，一定要让我听听。\n我也会倾尽全力演唱的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1715.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"35529d1cbf6523398726c4c9ef46d3c0c1577ff622940ef793114a71296a906b","ja":"（これはもしかして……\nふたりのソングバトル！？　スクープです～……）","zh":"（这难道是……\n两人的歌唱对决！？是大独家呀～……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1715.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"254932e7745e2ace8281e929bd5dbc146b0e5e3e7e93921ed2d2c454cfa3f8c3","ja":"……素晴らしかったわ、静香。\nのびのびとした、力強い歌声で。","zh":"……很出色哦，静香。\n歌声舒展自如，又充满力量。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1715.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"fe6360dd9c603267ee77629cdcf1c39b8020aacab8ee1a992490c60bb3e41390","ja":"千早さんこそ！　対決のこと、つい忘れちゃいそうな\nくらい、夢中で聞き入ってしまいました。","zh":"千早才厉害呢！听得我都入迷了，\n甚至差点忘了这还是在对决。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1715.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"9213b4a558623ff47ae40562af5af24a8e62a1d26223d0ab430c6a352af1c49c","ja":"本番の歌唱対決でも、しっかり戦いましょう。","zh":"在正式的歌唱对决中，也全力应战吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1715.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"4e0a332c38c13d3d5f15f881c569191171524f5750c9a03de5d9b40089c38637","ja":"はい！　収録は来週末でしたよね。\nそれまでに、さらにレッスンを重ねます！","zh":"好的！录制是在下周末对吧。\n在那之前，我会加倍练习的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1715.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"83919db71af880f4aa847f655e2590269b0781e0b422a32a47dae08165f31d7b","ja":"（あれ！？　これもプライベートじゃ\nなかったんですか！？　うう、スクープが……）","zh":"（咦！？原来这个也不是\n私底下的生活吗！？呜呜，独家新闻飞了……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
